<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kellogg lowered by DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kellogg lowered by DLJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette downgraded Kellogg Co to underperform from market perform due to the stock's price, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- the stock fell 1-5/16 to 96-1/8.</p>
</text>
